            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "e. Association officers and delegates shall be granted yearly up to twenty-six (26) days off each for purposes of attending business meetings. Said officers and delegates shall not be paid by the County, but shall, at the employee's option, have the right to have such leave charged to his/her accrued vacation, personal, or compensatory leave credits. Sick leave may not be charged for the purpose of attending any of the meeting(s) above.",
