        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. All members of the negotiating unit shall present grievances through a Union steward or elected Union officer in accordance with this Article, provided, however, that the first presentation of the grievances must occur within twenty (20) working days of occurrence and provided that the grievance is presented in writing containing a brief statement of the nature of the grievance and the specific provision(s) of the Agreement alleged to have been violated.",
            "block_bbox": [
                874,
